847 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Value corruption occurs because the C\055statement counter\053\053 decomposes at the machine assembly level into three distinct\054 non\055atomic instructions\072 Load \050read variable from RAM\057L3 into register\051\054 Add \050increment register value by 1\051\054 and Store \050write register value back to RAM\051\056 When multiple CPU cores execute this sequence concurrently without isolation\054 their execution windows interleave\056 Core A and Core B read the same initial value simultaneously\054 increment it locally\054 and overwrite each other\047s updates during the Store phase\054 resulting in lost updates and severe data corruption\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 848 0 R
     /Pg 804 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

