849 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Locked execution is substantially slower \050\17617\327 slower in this test\051 because a Mutex enforces complete serialization on shared memory\054 effectively neutralizing parallel performance\056 Threads are forced to execute sequentially\054 spending significant cycles waiting in lock contention queues\056 Furthermore\054 acquiring and releasing locks introduces thread\055context switching overhead\054 cache line invalidation across cores\054 and memory barrier instructions that stall processor pipelines\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 850 0 R
     /Pg 804 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
