891 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My host Apple M3 architecture operates across Flynn\031s Taxonomy depending on the workload\072 it functions as SISD during single\055threaded sequential execution \050such as basic OS logic or single\055pass compilation\051 where one CPU core processes a single instruction stream on one data stream\073 it utilizes SIMD through ARM NEON vector extensions and hardware dot\055product acceleration \050FEAT\137DotProd\051 to execute a single vector instruction across multiple data elements simultaneously for matrix and signal processing\073 and it manifests as MIMD during concurrent OS multi\055threading\054 where independent execution threads run across the 8 physical cores \0504 Performance and 4 Efficiency cores\051 executing distinct instruction streams on separate memory spaces concurrently\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 892 0 R
     /Pg 806 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

