961 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Speedup saturated immediately at \044N\0752\044 \050\044S\1372 \075 0\05697\134times\044\051 and sharply reversed as thread counts increased\056 On this Apple M3 host\054 this early saturation occurs because Python\031s process creation overhead via multiprocessing \050memory space duplication and IPC serialization\051 exceeds the compute density of the short workload \050\1760\05633s\051\056 Furthermore\054 the heterogeneous core topology \0504 Performance \053 4 Efficiency cores\051 creates hardware bottlenecking\072 when threads scale beyond 4\054 tasks are scheduled onto slower E\055cores and trigger CPU memory bandwidth contention alongside OS context\055switching overhead across the 8 physical cores\054 causing execution times to degrade substantially\056)
     /K [ 47 ]
     /P 962 0 R
     /Pg 806 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
